.TH INSPECT-PROXMOX-HOST-SEAL 8 "2026-09-21" "inspect-proxmox-host" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
inspect-proxmox-host-seal \- remove every Proxmox API token before imaging a host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B inspect-proxmox-host-seal
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes all API tokens of all Proxmox users on this node, so that none is carried
into hosts launched from an image of it. Run it as the last step before snapshotting
a host into an AMI or template.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pveum (1)
